WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.040
Every graph, cut into cycles.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.121
Here two five-cycles use every edge. Can

3
00:00:05.121 --> 00:00:07.111
any graph split into few cycles?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.276
Shrink the graph, solve the smaller one, then lift each cycle back.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.827
Claimed: a constant times n pieces, always.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.916
Main theorem in Lean.
